  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/orest-cli (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and executes a bundled 727KB obfuscated payload (math_init.js) at install time. The payload uses a custom string-array/base64 decoder to hide its logic. The package also declares dependencies on known-malicious packages @or-sdk/files, @or-sdk/library, and @or-sdk/sdk-api. Installing this package runs the obfuscated payload before any of the CLI's legitimate code executes.",
